{
  "version": 1,
  "corpus": "Northwind Systems synthetic corpus (22 documents)",
  "notes": [
    "Four categories, deliberately. Factoid and multi_hop measure whether the",
    "system finds and reports what is there. permission_negative and",
    "unanswerable measure whether it declines when it should - and those two",
    "are the reason this benchmark is worth running at all, because a system",
    "that answers everything scores perfectly on factoids and is useless.",
    "",
    "expected_facts entries use '|' for acceptable alternatives. Matching is",
    "case-insensitive substring over whitespace-normalised text; it checks that",
    "the specific number or term appears, not that the phrasing matches."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
